Package: ridgeguard
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, bash (>= 4.0), coreutils, sed, grep
Recommends: openssh-server, ufw, fail2ban
Description: Automated Ubuntu server hardening and Docker setup
 A modular toolset for bootstrapping fresh Ubuntu servers with security
 hardening and Docker (rootful or rootless). Includes SSH hardening, UFW
 firewall configuration, fail2ban, kernel sysctl tuning, unattended upgrades,
 and Docker Engine installation. Prepares servers for Coolify.
